flowchart TB
  event[Push / PR / weekly / manual] --> caller[Product-owned ci.yml / read-only permissions]
  caller --> classify[Reusable classify job / Linux]
  classify --> base[Resolve exact comparison commit / ancestry or schedule SHA]
  base -- missing zero equal nonancestor --> fail[Classify job failure / final gate rejects]
  base --> paths[Sorted deduplicated changed paths]
  paths --> selection{Markdown-only?}
  selection -- yes --> docs[Dependency install / document and constitution skill gates]
  selection -- no --> matrix[Selected OS matrix / shared or unknown means three OS]
  docs -- success --> skip[Product full explicitly skipped]
  docs -- dependency or document check failed --> fail
  matrix --> deps[Per-OS checkout / logical CPU budget / dependencies]
  deps --> gates[make ci / all related targets / Node file concurrency 1]
  deps -- failed --> results
  gates --> results[Aggregate full success / failure / cancel / timeout]
  skip --> final[Always gate / verifyResults]
  results --> final
  fail --> final
  final -- classify success and matching selected result --> success[CI gate success]
  final -- missing unknown or selected skip --> rejected[CI gate failure / exit 2]
  docs --> current[Current facts drift and local links / no base-relative history check]
  source[Install and OS setup / public product relays] --> distribution[HOME links / config / update / separate verify]
  distribution --> session[Parent session recognition is a separate acceptance]
  hook[Windows capacity hook source / no marker waiting] -. actual deployed version unknown .-> matrix
